.TH focusforge-cli-check-update 1  "check-update 0.2.0-rc.1" 
.SH NAME
focusforge\-cli\-check\-update \- Ask the release server whether a newer FocusForge release exists
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfocusforge\-cli check\-update\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-v \fR]... [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Ask the release server whether a newer FocusForge release exists.
.PP
Makes one request that carries only the program version. Exit status: 0 when this version is up to date, 3 when a newer release is available, 1 when the check failed.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit the JSON report instead of human\-readable text
.TP
\fB\-v\fR
Increase log detail (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Log errors only
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH VERSION
v0.2.0\-rc.1
